      │ # docker load < hello-2.10.tar.gz
      │ # docker run hello-2.10:latest hello
      │ Hello, world!

Description

nix bundle, by default, packs the closure of the 
installable into a single self-extracting executable. See
the bundlers homepage https://github.com/NixOS/bundlers for
more details.

  │ Note
  │ 
  │ This command only works on Linux.

